{%- comment -%}
  Cuenta ELYXIE — UNA sección que sirve TODOS los contextos de cliente, ramificando
  por `request.path`. Vive bajo el layout `elyxie-page` (wordmark champán + ES/EN +
  carrito + footer de marca + vacío esmeralda), así que aquí no se construye chrome.

  Ramas (Dawn → re-skin elyxie):
    /account/login      → recover_customer_password + customer_login (+ Sign in with Shop nativo)
    /account/register   → create_customer
    /account/addresses  → customer_address CRUD (depende de customer.js → CustomerAddresses)
    /account/orders|…   → detalle de pedido (objeto `order`)
    /account/reset      → reset_customer_password
    /account/activate   → activate_customer_password
    else (/account)     → panel: bienvenida, pedidos recientes, direcciones, salir

  Reglas de marca aplicadas: inputs/botones de esquina viva (0px), foco champán,
  CTA primario en degradado oro, secundario fantasma, errores en bronce #D97757,
  titulares en Cormorant italic. Bilingüe ES/EN — el español lidera.

  El selector de país/provincia y el borrado de dirección usan `Shopify.CountryProvinceSelector`
  y `Shopify.postLink`, ambos definidos en global.js (cargado por el layout). El toggle
  add/edit/cancel/delete lo gobierna customer.js, que se carga abajo. NO renombrar los
  data-* ni los id de los campos de dirección: customer.js los busca por nombre exacto.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign is_en = false -%}
{%- if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' -%}{%- assign is_en = true -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%} Ruta normalizada (sin prefijo de locale tipo /en) para ramificar. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign p = request.path -%}

<style>
  .eacct {
    --ea-surface: #0E2E26;
    --ea-surface-raised: #143C32;
    --ea-hair: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    --ea-hair-strong: rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    --ea-hair-champ: rgba(233,215,177,0.22);
    --ea-error: #D97757;
    --ea-phosphor: #7DFFB2;
    max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(40px,7vw,96px) clamp(20px,5vw,64px) clamp(80px,12vw,152px);
    font-family: var(--ep-sans);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);
  }
  /* Ancho contenido para las ramas tipo formulario (login/register/reset/activate):
     un formulario de lujo respira, no se estira a 1180px. */
  .eacct--narrow { max-width: 560px; }

  /* ── Cabecera editorial ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .eacct__eyebrow { margin: 0; font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ep-champ); }
  .eacct__title { margin: clamp(12px,1.4vw,18px) 0 0; font-family: var(--ep-serif); font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(38px,5.4vw,72px); line-height: 1.0; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--ep-ink); text-wrap: balance; }
  .eacct__lede { margin: clamp(16px,1.8vw,22px) 0 0; max-width: 54ch; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); }
  .eacct__lede p { margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .eacct__lede p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .eacct__rule { height: 1px; border: 0; margin: clamp(28px,4vw,44px) 0 0;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ea-hair-champ), rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 40%, transparent); }

  /* ── Campos (esquina viva, foco champán, label Satoshi) ───────────────── */
  .eacct__form { margin-top: clamp(28px,4vw,44px); }
  .eacct__field { position: relative; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .eacct__field label { display: block; margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: var(--ep-sans);
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); transition: color 240ms ease; }
  .eacct__field input,
  .eacct__select select {
    width: 100%; height: 56px; margin: 0; padding: 0 16px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); color: var(--ep-ink);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); border-radius: 0;
    font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4;
    transition: border-color 240ms ease, background 240ms ease;
    appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none;
  }
  .eacct__field input::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.34); }
  .eacct__field input:focus,
  .eacct__select select:focus {
    outline: none; border-color: var(--ep-champ); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }
  .eacct__field:focus-within label { color: var(--ep-champ); }
  /* Campo inválido: bronce desaturado, nunca rojo de semáforo. */
  .eacct__field input[aria-invalid="true"] { border-color: var(--ea-error); }

  /* Selects de dirección — flecha champán pintada a mano (Dawn inyecta su propio
     icon-caret en .svg-wrapper; lo ocultamos y usamos el nuestro para coherencia). */
  .eacct__select { position: relative; }
  .eacct__select select { padding-right: 42px; cursor: pointer; }
  .eacct__select option { color: #0A2620; }
  .eacct__select .svg-wrapper { position: absolute; right: 15px; bottom: 18px; width: 12px; height: 12px;
    pointer-events: none; color: var(--ep-champ); display: inline-flex; }
  .eacct__select .svg-wrapper svg { width: 100%; height: auto; }

  .eacct__checkbox { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 6px 0 22px; }
  .eacct__checkbox input[type="checkbox"] { width: 18px; height: 18px; margin: 0; flex: none;
    appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 0;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    display: grid; place-content: center; transition: background 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease; }
  .eacct__checkbox input[type="checkbox"]:checked { background: var(--ep-champ); border-color: var(--ep-champ); }
  .eacct__checkbox input[type="checkbox"]:checked::after { content: ''; width: 9px; height: 5px;
    border-left: 2px solid #0A2620; border-bottom: 2px solid #0A2620; transform: translateY(-1px) rotate(-45deg); }
  .eacct__checkbox input[type="checkbox"]:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ep-champ); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .eacct__checkbox label { margin: 0; font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-transform: none; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); cursor: pointer; }

  /* ── Botones ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .eacct__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 16px 24px; margin-top: 28px; }

  /* CTA precioso: degradado champán→oro, esquina viva, glow que crece en hover. */
  .eacct__btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;
    padding: 16px 40px; border: 0; border-radius: 0; cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #E9D7B1, #C9A66B); color: #0A2620;
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(233,215,177,0.25);
    transition: box-shadow 360ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0,0,1), transform 360ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0,0,1); }
  .eacct__btn:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 54px rgba(233,215,177,0.42); }
  .eacct__btn:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ep-champ); outline-offset: 4px; }

  /* Fantasma: transparente, borde hairline → champán en hover. */
  .eacct__btn--ghost { background: transparent; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); box-shadow: none; }
  .eacct__btn--ghost:hover { color: var(--ep-champ); border-color: var(--ea-hair-champ); box-shadow: none; }

  /* Enlace textual sobrio (cancelar, ¿olvidaste?, crear cuenta). */
  .eacct__link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-family: var(--ep-sans);
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(233,215,177,0.85); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;
    background: none; border: 0; padding: 0; transition: color 220ms ease; }
  .eacct__link:hover { color: var(--ep-champ); }
  .eacct__link svg { transition: transform 240ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0,0,1); }
  .eacct__link:hover svg { transform: translateX(4px); }
  .eacct__link--back svg { transform: scaleX(-1); }
  .eacct__link--back:hover svg { transform: scaleX(-1) translateX(4px); }

  /* ── Mensajes (error bronce / éxito fósforo) ──────────────────────────── */
  .eacct__msg { margin: 0 0 22px; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 12px;
    font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .eacct__msg--error { background: rgba(217,119,87,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(217,119,87,0.4);
    color: #F0C3B0; }
  .eacct__msg--error .eacct__msg-title { color: var(--ea-error); }
  .eacct__msg--success { background: rgba(125,255,178,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(125,255,178,0.35);
    color: #BFF6D6; }
  .eacct__msg-title { display: block; margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .eacct__msg ul { margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 18px; }
  .eacct__msg li { margin: 4px 0; }
  .eacct__msg a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .eacct__msg .svg-wrapper { display: none; } /* el SVG de error de Dawn — nuestra tipografía ya habla */
  /* Error de campo en línea (debajo del input). */
  .eacct__field-error { display: block; margin-top: 7px; font-family: var(--ep-sans);
    font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: var(--ea-error); }
  .eacct__field-error .svg-wrapper { display: none; }

  /* ── Sign in with Shop (bloque nativo, no se reestiliza por dentro) ────── */
  .eacct__shop { margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .eacct__shop-sep { margin: 22px 0; text-align: center; font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.42);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
  .eacct__shop-sep::before, .eacct__shop-sep::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px;
    background: var(--ea-hair); }

  /* ── Panel de cuenta (dashboard) ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  .eacct__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: clamp(24px,3vw,40px);
    margin-top: clamp(32px,4vw,48px); }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .eacct__grid { grid-template-columns: 1.65fr 1fr; align-items: start; } }

  .eacct__card { background: var(--ea-surface); border-radius: 18px; padding: clamp(24px,3vw,36px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(5,22,19,0.45), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.06); }
  .eacct__card-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 22px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .eacct__card-title { margin: 0; font-family: var(--ep-serif); font-style: italic; font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(24px,2.6vw,32px); line-height: 1.1; color: var(--ep-ink); }

  /* ── Tabla de pedidos (historial) ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .eacct__table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  .eacct__table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: var(--ep-sans);
    font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); }
  .eacct__table caption { text-align: left; }
  .eacct__table th { font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); text-align: left; font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0 18px 14px 0; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ea-hair-champ); }
  .eacct__table td { padding: 18px 18px 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ea-hair);
    vertical-align: top; }
  .eacct__table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
  .eacct__table td[data-num], .eacct__table th[data-num] { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .eacct__table a { color: var(--ep-champ); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ea-hair-champ); padding-bottom: 2px; transition: color 200ms ease; }
  .eacct__table a:hover { color: #fff; }
  .eacct__empty { margin: 0; font-family: var(--ep-serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 20px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }

  /* Paginación — espejo del pager de la Colección (esquina viva, activa champán). */
  .eacct__pager { display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;
    margin-top: clamp(28px,4vw,40px); list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .eacct__pager li { margin: 0; }
  .eacct__pager a, .eacct__pager span { min-width: 40px; height: 40px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;
    justify-content: center; padding: 0 10px; font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid var(--ea-hair); border-radius: 0;
    transition: color 220ms ease, border-color 220ms ease; }
  .eacct__pager a:hover { color: #fff; border-color: var(--ea-hair-champ); }
  .eacct__pager span[aria-current] { color: #0A2620; background: var(--ep-champ); border-color: var(--ep-champ); }
  .eacct__pager .svg-wrapper { display: inline-flex; }
  .eacct__pager .svg-wrapper svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }

  /* Dirección formateada (format_address) dentro de tarjetas. */
  .eacct__address { font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); }
  .eacct__address p { margin: 0; }
  .eacct__sublabel { margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: var(--ep-sans); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ep-champ); }

  /* ── Detalle de pedido ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .eacct__order-meta { margin: clamp(14px,1.6vw,20px) 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.62); }
  .eacct__order-meta p { margin: 0; }
  .eacct__order-meta strong { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-weight: 500; }
  .eacct__order-table tfoot td { border-bottom: 0; padding-top: 14px; padding-bottom: 6px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
  .eacct__order-table tfoot tr:last-child td { font-family: var(--ep-serif); font-size: 20px;
    color: #fff; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ea-hair-champ); }
  .eacct__order-table .properties span, .eacct__order-table .fulfillment span,
  .eacct__order-table .properties, .eacct__order-table .fulfillment {
    display: block; font-size: 12.5px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); margin-top: 4px; }
  .eacct__order-table dl { margin: 0; }
  .eacct__order-table .regular-price s { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
  .eacct__order-table .svg-wrapper { display: none; }
  .eacct__order-addresses { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: clamp(24px,3vw,40px);
    margin-top: clamp(32px,4vw,48px); }
  @media (min-width: 760px) { .eacct__order-addresses { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }

  /* ── Direcciones CRUD ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .eacct__addr-list { list-style: none; margin: clamp(28px,4vw,44px) 0 0; padding: 0;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  @media (min-width: 760px) { .eacct__addr-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  .eacct__addr-item { background: var(--ea-surface); border-radius: 18px; padding: clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(5,22,19,0.4), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.06); }
  /* Fila de acciones edit/delete — botones hermanos directos (sin wrapper). El borde
     superior nace en el botón Edit; el Delete lo acompaña en la misma línea. */
  .eacct__addr-item > .eacct__addr-toggle--edit { display: inline-flex; margin-top: 20px;
    padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ea-hair); }
  .eacct__addr-item > .eacct__addr-del { display: inline-flex; margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 22px;
    padding-top: 18px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
  .eacct__addr-item > .eacct__addr-del:hover { color: var(--ea-error); }
  /* Colapso add/edit — espejo del mecanismo de Dawn (customer.css usa el combinador
     hermano general `~`): el botón toggle es hermano DIRECTO del div colapsable dentro
     de [data-address], y customer.js solo voltea aria-expanded. NO anidar el botón en
     un wrapper, o se rompe la relación de hermanos. */
  .eacct [data-address] [aria-expanded] ~ div[id] { display: none; }
  .eacct [data-address] [aria-expanded='true'] ~ div[id] { display: block; }
  .eacct [data-address] > div[id] { margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ea-hair-champ); }
  .eacct__addr-new { margin-top: clamp(8px,1vw,12px); }
  .eacct__addr-new > .eacct__addr-toggle { margin-top: clamp(20px,3vw,32px); }
  .eacct__addr-fields { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0 18px; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .eacct__addr-fields { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  .eacct__addr-fields .eacct__field--full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }

  /* Revelado escalonado de la columna (sutil, respeta reduced-motion). */
  .eacct__reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px);
    animation: eacct-rise 720ms cubic-bezier(0.05,0.7,0.1,1) both; }
  @keyframes eacct-rise { to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .eacct__actions { gap: 14px; }
    .eacct__btn { width: 100%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .eacct__reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; animation: none; }
    .eacct__btn, .eacct__link svg, .eacct__table a { transition: none; }
  }
</style>

{%- comment -%} ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   RAMA 1 — LOGIN  (recover_customer_password + customer_login + Sign in with Shop)
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if p contains '/account/login' -%}
  {%- if section.settings.enable_shop_login_button == false -%}
    {%- assign hide_shop_login_button = true -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  <section class="eacct eacct--narrow eacct__reveal">
    {%- comment -%} Recuperar contraseña — anclada en #recover, el enlace "olvidé" la activa. {%- endcomment -%}
    <div id="recover" tabindex="-1">
      <p class="eacct__eyebrow">{% if is_en %}Sacred Waters{% else %}Aguas Sagradas{% endif %}</p>
      <h1 class="eacct__title">{% if is_en %}Reset your password{% else %}Recupera tu contraseña{% endif %}</h1>
      <div class="eacct__lede"><p>{% if is_en %}We will send a link to restore access to your account.{% else %}Te enviaremos un enlace para restaurar el acceso a tu cuenta.{% endif %}</p></div>

      {%- form 'recover_customer_password' -%}
        {% assign recover_success = form.posted_successfully? %}
        <div class="eacct__form">
          <div class="eacct__field">
            <label for="RecoverEmail">{% if is_en %}Email{% else %}Correo electrónico{% endif %}</label>
            <input
              type="email"
              value=""
              name="email"
              id="RecoverEmail"
              autocorrect="off"
              autocapitalize="off"
              autocomplete="email"
              {% if form.errors %}
                aria-invalid="true"
                aria-describedby="RecoverEmail-email-error"
                autofocus
              {% endif %}
              placeholder="{% if is_en %}you@example.com{% else %}tu@ejemplo.com{% endif %}"
            >
          </div>
          {%- if form.errors -%}
            <small id="RecoverEmail-email-error" class="eacct__field-error">
              <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
              {{ form.errors.messages.form }}
            </small>
          {%- endif -%}

          <div class="eacct__actions">
            <button class="eacct__btn" type="submit">{% if is_en %}Send link{% else %}Enviar enlace{% endif %}</button>
            <a class="eacct__link eacct__link--back" href="#login">
              <svg width="13" height="9" viewBox="0 0 13 9" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 4.5h10M7.5 1L11 4.5 7.5 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              {% if is_en %}Back to sign in{% else %}Volver a iniciar sesión{% endif %}
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endform -%}
    </div>

    <hr class="eacct__rule">

    {%- comment -%} Iniciar sesión — anclada en #login. {%- endcomment -%}
    <div id="login" tabindex="-1" style="margin-top: clamp(32px,4vw,48px);">
      <p class="eacct__eyebrow">{% if is_en %}Your Account{% else %}Tu Cuenta{% endif %}</p>
      <h1 class="eacct__title">{% if is_en %}Sign in{% else %}Iniciar sesión{% endif %}</h1>

      {%- if recover_success == true -%}
        <div class="eacct__msg eacct__msg--success" tabindex="-1" autofocus role="status">
          <span class="eacct__msg-title">{% if is_en %}Link sent{% else %}Enlace enviado{% endif %}</span>
          {% if is_en %}We sent you an email with a link to update your password.{% else %}Te enviamos un correo con un enlace para actualizar tu contraseña.{% endif %}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- form 'customer_login', novalidate: 'novalidate' -%}
        {%- if form.errors -%}
          <div class="eacct__msg eacct__msg--error" tabindex="-1" autofocus role="alert">
            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'accessibility.error' | t }} </span>
            <span class="eacct__msg-title">{% if is_en %}We could not sign you in{% else %}No pudimos iniciar tu sesión{% endif %}</span>
            {{ form.errors | default_errors }}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="eacct__form">
          {%- comment -%} Sign in with Shop — bloque nativo. Se renderiza tal cual lo emite Shopify. {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if shop.features.login_with_shop_classic_customer_accounts? -%}
            <section name="sign-in-with-shop-provider" class="eacct__shop">
              {{ shop | login_button: hide_button: hide_shop_login_button }}

              {%- unless hide_shop_login_button -%}
                <p class="eacct__shop-sep">{% if is_en %}or{% else %}o{% endif %}</p>
              {%- endunless -%}
            </section>
          {%- endif -%}

          <div class="eacct__field">
            <label for="CustomerEmail">{% if is_en %}Email{% else %}Correo electrónico{% endif %}</label>
            <input
              type="email"
              name="customer[email]"
              id="CustomerEmail"
              autocomplete="email"
              autocorrect="off"
              autocapitalize="off"
              {% if form.errors contains 'form' %}aria-invalid="true"{% endif %}
              placeholder="{% if is_en %}you@example.com{% else %}tu@ejemplo.com{% endif %}"
            >
          </div>

          {%- if form.password_needed -%}
            <div class="eacct__field">
              <label for="CustomerPassword">{% if is_en %}Password{% else %}Contraseña{% endif %}</label>
              <input
                type="password"
                value=""
                name="customer[password]"
                id="CustomerPassword"
                autocomplete="current-password"
                {% if form.errors contains 'form' %}aria-invalid="true"{% endif %}
                placeholder="{% if is_en %}Your password{% else %}Tu contraseña{% endif %}"
              >
            </div>

            <a class="eacct__link" href="#recover">{% if is_en %}Forgot your password?{% else %}¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?{% endif %}</a>
          {%- endif -%}

          <div class="eacct__actions">
            <button class="eacct__btn" type="submit">{% if is_en %}Sign in{% else %}Entrar{% endif %}</button>
            <a class="eacct__link" href="{{ routes.account_register_url }}">
              {% if is_en %}Create account{% else %}Crear cuenta{% endif %}
              <svg width="13" height="9" viewBox="0 0 13 9" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 4.5h10M7.5 1L11 4.5 7.5 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endform -%}

      {%- comment -%} Continuar como invitado (si el checkout lo permite). {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if shop.checkout.guest_login -%}
        <hr class="eacct__rule">
        <div style="margin-top: clamp(28px,4vw,40px);">
          <h2 class="eacct__card-title" style="font-size: clamp(22px,2.4vw,28px);">{% if is_en %}Continue as guest{% else %}Continuar como invitado{% endif %}</h2>
          {%- form 'guest_login' -%}
            <div class="eacct__actions">
              <button class="eacct__btn eacct__btn--ghost" type="submit">{% if is_en %}Continue{% else %}Continuar{% endif %}</button>
            </div>
          {%- endform -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </section>

{%- comment -%} ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   RAMA 2 — REGISTER  (create_customer)
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ {%- endcomment -%}
{%- elsif p contains '/account/register' -%}
  <section class="eacct eacct--narrow eacct__reveal">
    <p class="eacct__eyebrow">{% if is_en %}Join ELYXIE{% else %}Únete a ELYXIE{% endif %}</p>
    <h1 class="eacct__title">{% if is_en %}Create your account{% else %}Crea tu cuenta{% endif %}</h1>
    <div class="eacct__lede"><p>{% if is_en %}Keep your pieces, your orders and your editions in one place.{% else %}Guarda tus piezas, tus pedidos y tus ediciones en un solo lugar.{% endif %}</p></div>

    {%- form 'create_customer', novalidate: 'novalidate' -%}
      <div class="eacct__form">
        {%- if form.errors -%}
          <div class="eacct__msg eacct__msg--error" tabindex="-1" autofocus role="alert">
            <span class="eacct__msg-title">{% if is_en %}Please review the form{% else %}Revisa el formulario{% endif %}</span>
            <ul>
              {%- for field in form.errors -%}
                <li>
                  {%- if field == 'form' -%}
                    {{ form.errors.messages[field] }}
                  {%- else -%}
                    <a href="#RegisterForm-{{ field }}">
                      {{ form.errors.translated_fields[field] | capitalize }}
                      {{ form.errors.messages[field] }}
                    </a>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </li>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="eacct__addr-fields">
          <div class="eacct__field">
            <label for="RegisterForm-FirstName">{% if is_en %}First name{% else %}Nombre{% endif %}</label>
            <input
              type="text"
              name="customer[first_name]"
              id="RegisterForm-FirstName"
              {% if form.first_name %}value="{{ form.first_name }}"{% endif %}
              autocomplete="given-name"
              placeholder="{% if is_en %}First name{% else %}Nombre{% endif %}"
            >
          </div>
          <div class="eacct__field">
            <label for="RegisterForm-LastName">{% if is_en %}Last name{% else %}Apellido{% endif %}</label>
            <input
              type="text"
              name="customer[last_name]"
              id="RegisterForm-LastName"
              {% if form.last_name %}value="{{ form.last_name }}"{% endif %}
              autocomplete="family-name"
              placeholder="{% if is_en %}Last name{% else %}Apellido{% endif %}"
            >
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="eacct__field">
          <label for="RegisterForm-email">{% if is_en %}Email{% else %}Correo electrónico{% endif %}</label>
          <input
            type="email"
            name="customer[email]"
            id="RegisterForm-email"
            {% if form.email %}value="{{ form.email }}"{% endif %}
            spellcheck="false"
            autocapitalize="off"
            autocomplete="email"
            aria-required="true"
            {% if form.errors contains 'email' %}
              aria-invalid="true"
              aria-describedby="RegisterForm-email-error"
            {% endif %}
            placeholder="{% if is_en %}you@example.com{% else %}tu@ejemplo.com{% endif %}"
          >
          {%- if form.errors contains 'email' -%}
            <span id="RegisterForm-email-error" class="eacct__field-error">
              <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
              {{ form.errors.translated_fields.email | capitalize }}
              {{ form.errors.messages.email }}.
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        <div class="eacct__field">
          <label for="RegisterForm-password">{% if is_en %}Password{% else %}Contraseña{% endif %}</label>
          <input
            type="password"
            name="customer[password]"
            id="RegisterForm-password"
            aria-required="true"
            {% if form.errors contains 'password' %}
              aria-invalid="true"
              aria-describedby="RegisterForm-password-error"
            {% endif %}
            placeholder="{% if is_en %}Choose a password{% else %}Elige una contraseña{% endif %}"
          >
          {%- if form.errors contains 'password' -%}
            <span id="RegisterForm-password-error" class="eacct__field-error">
              <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-error.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
              {{ form.errors.translated_fields.password | capitalize }}
              {{ form.errors.messages.password }}.
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        <div class="eacct__actions">
          <button class="eacct__btn" type="submit">{% if is_en %}Create account{% else %}Crear cuenta{% endif %}</button>
          <a class="eacct__link eacct__link--back" href="{{ routes.account_login_url }}">
            <svg width="13" height="9" viewBox="0 0 13 9" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 4.5h10M7.5 1L11 4.5 7.5 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            {% if is_en %}I already have an account{% else %}Ya tengo cuenta{% endif %}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endform -%}
  </section>

{%- comment -%} ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
